---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import PageHead from "../components/PageHead.astro";
import Empty from "../components/Empty.astro";
import { site, url } from "../lib/site";
---
<Base title="Mistakes" current="mistakes/">
  <PageHead eyebrow="Append-only" title="Mistakes">
    Decisions that turned out wrong: a trade, a refusal, a market view, a flaw in the strategy. For each: what was wrong, what it cost, and what rule would have prevented it. Written by the agent, or by the owner when the agent missed one; lines are never removed. Failures of the machinery are not mistakes of judgement and live on the <a href={url("operations/")}>operations log</a>.
  </PageHead>
  <div class="wrap">{site.mistakes_html
    ? <article class="card pad prose wide doc" set:html={site.mistakes_html} />
    : <Empty title="No wrong decision yet">Nothing has been traded yet, so no decision has had the chance to be wrong. When one is, the entry goes here and stays here.</Empty>}</div>
</Base>
<style>.doc { padding: clamp(24px, 4vw, 48px); }</style>
